diagram shown in Figure <a href="#S7.F5" title="Figure 5 ‣ 7. The 𝑎-Catalan arrangements ‣ Labeling regions in deformations of graphical arrangements" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a></figcaption>
